docs {
  # ApafaService.SaveMeeting

  `/ltedu.apafa.v1.ApafaService/SaveMeeting` · unary · `ltedu/apafa/v1/apafa.proto`

  ## Request — `SaveMeetingRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `meeting` | `Meeting` | Empty id: a new meeting. Only title, kind, scheduled_at, modality, place, meeting_url, agenda and audience are read |
  | `notify` | `bool` | Convene it (a draft) or tell the families what changed (already convened) |

  ## Response — `SaveMeetingResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `meeting` | `Meeting` |  |

  ## Tipos

  ### `Meeting`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `id` | `string` |  |
  | `title` | `string` |  |
  | `kind` | `string` | ordinary \| extraordinary \| assembly \| board |
  | `scheduled_at` | `string` | RFC 3339 |
  | `modality` | `string` | in_person \| virtual \| hybrid |
  | `place` | `string` |  |
  | `meeting_url` | `string` |  |
  | `agenda` | `string` |  |
  | `audience` | `string` | guardians \| community |
  | `status` | `string` | scheduled \| rescheduled \| held \| cancelled |
  | `previous_at` | `string` |  |
  | `reschedule_reason` | `string` |  |
  | `cancel_reason` | `string` |  |
  | `minutes` | `string` |  |
  | `agreements` | `string` |  |
  | `attendees` | `optional int32` |  |
  | `minutes_published_at` | `string` | When the acta was published to the families (empty: not yet) |
  | `announcement_id` | `string` | Last notice sent (comms announcement) and when it was first convened (empty: a draft) |
  | `notified_at` | `string` |  |
  | `created_name` | `string` |  |
  | `created_at` | `string` |  |
  | `updated_at` | `string` |  |
